    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Wisdom’s Worth"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My son, if you accept my words",
          "and store up my commands within you,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "listening closely to wisdom",
          "and directing your heart to understanding;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "furthermore, if you call out to insight",
          "and lift your voice to understanding,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "if you seek it like silver",
          "and search for it like hidden treasure,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "then you will understand the fear of the Lord",
          "and discover the knowledge of God."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For the Lord gives wisdom;",
          "from his mouth come knowledge and understanding."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He stores up success for the upright;",
          "He is a shield for those who live with integrity"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "so that he may guard the paths of justice",
          "and protect the way of his faithful followers."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then you will understand righteousness, justice,",
          "and integrity #— #every good path."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For wisdom will enter your heart,",
          "and knowledge will delight you."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Discretion will watch over you,",
          "and understanding will guard you."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "It will rescue you from the way of evil —",
          "from anyone who says perverse things,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "from those who abandon the right paths",
          "to walk in ways of darkness,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "from those who enjoy doing evil",
          "and celebrate perversion,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "whose paths are crooked,",
          "and whose ways are devious."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "It will rescue you from a forbidden woman,",
          "from a wayward woman with her flattering talk,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "who abandons the companion of her youth",
          "and forgets the covenant of her God;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "for her house sinks down to death",
          "and her ways to the land of the departed spirits."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "None return who go to her;",
          "none reach the paths of life."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "So follow the way of the good,",
          "and keep to the paths of the righteous."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For the upright will inhabit the land,",
          "and those of integrity will remain in it;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "but the wicked will be cut off from the land,",
          "and the treacherous ripped out of it."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      }
    ]
  },
